children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the minimum number of indices (positions) that Polycarp needs to select to make the string liked? What should these positions be?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases in the input. Next, the test cases are given."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of one non-empty string $$$s$$$. Its length does not exceed $$$1.5\\cdot10^5$$$. The string $$$s$$$ consists only of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of lengths of all lines for all input data in the test does not exceed $$$1.5\\cdot10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print an answer for each test case in the input in order of their appearance."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each answer should contain $$$r$$$ ($$$0 \\le r \\le |s|$$$) — the required minimum number of positions to be removed, where $$$|s|$$$ is the length of the given line. The second line of each answer should contain $$$r$$$ different integers — the indices themselves for removal in any order. Indices are numbered from left to right from $$$1$$$ to the length of the string. If $$$r=0$$$, then the second line can be skipped (or you can print empty). If there are several answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role"